<div class="canvas" aria-label="Value Proposition Canvas 範例：等待時間提示功能對應外送員需求">
  <div class="column column--value"><p>Value Proposition</p><div><b>📦 Products &amp; Services</b><span>等待時間提示功能 <em class="assumption">解法假設</em></span></div><div><b>💊 Pain Relievers</b><span>緩解「不知道還要等多久」的焦躁</span></div><div><b>📈 Gain Creators</b><span>目前沒有對應功能 <em>未覆蓋</em></span></div></div>
  <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓ 對照使用者需求 ↓</span>
  <div class="column column--customer"><p>Customer Profile</p><div><b>📋 Customer Jobs</b><span>想準時接下一單</span></div><div><b>😣 Pains</b><span>不知道還要等多久 <em class="evidence">已有證據</em></span></div><div><b>😊 Gains</b><span>希望等待時能做點別的事 <em class="assumption">待驗證</em></span></div></div>
</div>
<style>.canvas{display:grid;justify-items:center;gap:10px;width:min(100%,480px)}.column{display:grid;gap:6px;width:100%}.column>p{margin:0 0 2px!important;text-align:left;font-size:12px!important;font-weight:700}.column>div{padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}.column b,.column span{display:block}.column b{margin-bottom:3px;font-size:10px}.column--value>p,.column--value b{color:var(--accent)}.column--value>div{border-color:rgba(125,211,252,.35);background:rgba(125,211,252,.09)}.column--customer>p,.column--customer b{color:#fb7185}.column--customer>div{border-color:rgba(251,113,133,.35);background:rgba(251,113,133,.09)}.column em{display:inline-block;margin-top:4px;padding:1px 5px;border:1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.4);border-radius:5px;background:rgba(251,191,36,.12);color:#fbbf24;font-size:9px;font-style:normal}.column .evidence{border-color:rgba(52,211,153,.4);background:rgba(52,211,153,.1);color:#6ee7b7}.column .assumption{border-color:rgba(167,139,250,.45);background:rgba(167,139,250,.1);color:#c4b5fd}.arrow{color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.03em}</style>
